@startuml state-deployment
!include style.iuml
title Deployment status

[*] --> pending : manual deploy, auto-deploy,\nwaiting place or teardown\n(INSERT, one per slot)
pending --> running : worker created the Job
pending --> failed : Job could not start\n(target removed, spec error)
running --> succeeded : Job succeeded
running --> failed : Job failed\nor disappeared
running --> timed_out : Job deadline (jobTimeout)\nor jobTimeout + 2 min grace
succeeded --> [*]
failed --> [*]
timed_out --> [*]

note right of running
  Logs stream live over SSE.
  The worker stores at most
  2 MiB of log when it finishes.
end note
note bottom of failed
  A lock taken by the deploy
  stays in place on failed
  and timed_out.
end note
@enduml
